### Verify GSTIN
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/gst/verify-gstin
Authorization: Bearer {{bearerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "gstin": "01AAFQQ9980MZQR",
  "forceRefresh": true
}

