### Cancel E-Invoice
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/gst/e-invoices/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{bearerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyGstRegistrationId": {{companyGstRegistrationId}},
  "irn": "{{irn}}",
  "cancelReasonCode": "3",
  "cancelRemark": "Testing cancellation"
}

### Get E-Invoice Details From GSTZen
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/gst/e-invoices/get-details
Authorization: Bearer {{bearerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyGstRegistrationId": {{companyGstRegistrationId}},
  "irn": "{{irn}}"
}

